# Host node_modules contain platform-native binaries (darwin-arm64). Copying them
# into a linux image silently shadows the ones pnpm installs there.
**/node_modules

# Build output — regenerated inside the image
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local state that must never end up in a published image
**/local.db
**/local.db-*
**/*.sqlite
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/generated-images

# Repo noise
.git
.github
**/.DS_Store
docs
*.md
!README.md
